        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polyurethane, flexible foam, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polyurethane, flexible foam, at plant
Datset represents just one possible composition for a flexible PUR foam.;
CAS number: 009009-54-5; 
Synonyms: PUR; 
UUID: e661012b-d2ba-37a2-bcf2-b7fd9ceb02a7
This dataset contains the transports of the monomers as well as the production (energy, air emissions) of the PUR foam
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Present technology used in Europe. Transport and infrastructure - average values added.
Time period: date of publication
Production volume: 5 Mt (Total PUR consumption 1990)
Sampling: data from industry report 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e661012b-d2ba-37a2-bcf2-b7fd9ceb02a7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
